            $k('What happens after the test is finished?', 'what happens after the test, after testing, test done what next, finished the test, next step after test, what to do after readings, after encoding results, test complete then what, tapos na ang test', 'When the readings are in, the report rates them and shows the overall result. Check it, set the status to Complete, then press "Request approval (QR)": the signatories get a Synology Chat message with a one-time sign link. After it is approved, the report can be sent through InterLink.', ['Check the readings and the result.', 'Set the status to Complete.', 'Press "Request approval (QR)".', 'After approval, send it through InterLink.'], $tr),
            $k('Where do I start with a new sample?', 'new sample start, receive a sample, sample arrived, how to start a test, begin testing, log a sample, first step, where to begin, new material received, bagong sample', 'Receive it first: log the material (code, supplier, date received) so it gets a Lab Reference, then open the report for its type in QC Lab Reports and enter or import the readings.', ['Log the sample in Materials / intake.', 'Open its report with the Lab Reference.', 'Enter or import the readings.'], $tr),
            $k('How do I know if my report is done?', 'is my report done, report status, is it complete, how do i know it is finished, status of my report, where is my report now, report progress, check status, nasaan na ang report ko', 'Look at the Status of the report in the Lab Tracker: In Progress means readings are still being entered, Pending Review means it waits for checking, Complete means it is finished. For signing, ask me "what are my for approval reports".', [], $tr),
            $k('What does Pass, Tolerable and Fail mean?', 'what does pass mean, what is a tolerable result, tolerable meaning, what is fail, pass tolerable fail difference, result meaning, ano ang tolerable, ano ang ibig sabihin ng pass, meaning of results, rating meaning, what is tolerable', 'Pass: the reading meets the standard. Tolerable: it does not quite meet the standard but is inside the allowed tolerance of the specification. Fail: it is outside the tolerance. The overall result of a report is the worst of its tests, so one Fail makes the whole report Fail.'),
            $k('Why is my report Fail when most tests passed?', 'why is the report fail, one test failed, overall result fail, report failed but tests passed, why overall fail, bakit fail, overall result is the worst, one failing reading', 'The overall result is the worst result of any test in the report. One failing reading makes the whole report Fail, even when the others pass. Open the report to see which test failed, then decide on a retest.', [], $tr),
            // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ approvals and follow-up
            $k('What does "for approval" mean?', 'for approval, what is for approval, pending approval meaning, waiting for signature, awaiting approval, for signing, pending signature, what does pending mean, unsigned, ano ang for approval', 'A report is "for approval" when approval was requested and no signatory has signed it yet. The signatories received a Synology Chat message with a sign link; the report stays pending until one signs or the link is resent.'),
            $k('How do I see the reports waiting for approval?', 'reports waiting for approval, list pending approvals, which reports are pending, show my reports for approval, what is waiting for signature, who has not signed, unsigned reports, pending approval list, how many are pending, mga report na hinihintay pirmahan', 'Ask me in your own words: "what are my for approval reports" (only the ones you requested) or "which reports are pending approval" (all). I list them numbered, with who is expected to sign and whether the link is still valid. Then you can say "resend approval for #1".'),
            $k('How do I resend the approval for a report?', 'resend approval, resend verification, send the approval again, remind the manager, remind the approver, resend the link, follow up approval, send reminder for approval, approval link expired resend, ulitin ang approval, re send the verification for this report', 'Say "resend approval for DTP..." with the Lab Reference, or list the reports first ("what are my for approval reports") and then say "resend the verification for this report", "resend #2" or "resend the first one". The signatories get a new Synology Chat message with a fresh sign link. I only resend when you ask for it, one report at a time.'),
            $k('How do I remind the manager to sign?', 'remind the manager, remind supervisor to sign, nudge the signatory, chase approval, manager has not signed, supervisor did not sign yet, notify the approver, ping the signatory, sign reminder, paalalahanan ang manager', 'Say "remind the approver for DTP..." or "resend approval for this report". The registered signatories get a Synology Chat message with the sign link. A signatory without a Synology ID linked in their profile cannot be messaged; the reply tells you who.'),
            $k('Can I send a message to Synology Chat?', 'send message to synology, synology chat message, message the manager, notify on synology, send synology notification, message supervisor synology, chat the signatory', 'I can message the signatories on Synology Chat about an approval: "resend approval for this report". I do not send free text messages to people; for that use the Inbox or Synology Chat itself.'),
            $k('Can you email a report or the approval?', 'email the report, send email, e-mail the approval, email to supplier, email follow up, send report by email, can you email this, mail the report, i want to send an email, send gmail, padala sa email', 'NEXUS-L does not send e-mail itself. Download the PDF and attach it to your own e-mail, share it through the Inbox, use "resend approval for this report" for the signatories (Synology Chat), or send it to the customer through InterLink.', [], ['actions' => [$o('Open Inbox', 'inbox')]]),
            $k('Who signs the report?', 'who signs the report, who approves, who are the signatories, who can sign, sino ang pipirma, manager approval, who gives final approval, signatory list, authorized signer', 'Only registered signatories (managers or supervisors with signing authority) can sign. Technicians cannot approve their own reports. Ask "who has not signed yet" to see what is waiting.'),
            $k('My approval link expired', 'approval link expired, link not working, sign link expired, expired approval, manager cannot open the link, link no longer valid, expired sign link, link expired', 'Sign links are valid for a limited time. Say "resend approval for DTP..." and a fresh link goes to the signatories. Ask "which approvals have an expired link" to see them.'),
            $k('Is my report approved yet?', 'is my report approved, was it signed, did the manager sign, approval status, is it approved, signed already, who approved my report, check approval, na-approve na ba', 'Ask "show approved reports" for the signed ones, or "what are my for approval reports" for those still waiting. The approved list shows who signed and when.'),
