            $k('How do I send the report to the customer?', 'send the report to the customer, send to interlink, deliver the report, submit to customer, send report out, who sends the report, ipadala ang report sa customer, upload to interlink', 'Customer reports go through InterLink. Prepare the report on the InterLink page; the PIC sends it with their own account. Only approved reports should be sent.', [], ['actions' => [$o('Open InterLink', 'interlink')]]),
            // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ pulling data
            $k('How do I get a list of all passed or failed reports?', 'list all pass, all tolerable reports, show all failed, give me all pass reports, pull all failed, list of tolerable, all reports with result, show every fail, ilista ang lahat ng pass, all results, get all passed', 'Ask in your own words: "show all tolerable reports", "all failed fabric this year", "list passed bonding reports this month". I read the QC data live and list the matches, newest first, numbered. Say "export them to Excel" to get the whole list as a file.'),
            $k('How many reports passed, tolerable or failed?', 'how many passed, how many tolerable, how many failed, count of results, totals pass fail, number of reports by result, ilan ang pass, total reports, summary of results', 'Ask "how many reports failed this month" or "pass rate of hardware this year": I count them live and show pass, tolerable and fail with percentages. A "pie chart of pass and fail" shows the same as a picture.'),
            $k('How do I look up one report?', 'look up a report, find a report, open a report by lab ref, details of a report, show the readings, results of DTP, what is the result of, hanapin ang report, report details', 'Write the Lab Reference, for example "DTP20261019F1-3" or "result of DTP20261019F1-3": I show the header and every reading and result, with a button to open it.'),
            $k('What is a Lab Reference?', 'what is a lab reference, lab ref number, what does DTP mean, report number, how is the lab reference made, lab ref meaning, ano ang lab reference, reference number of the report', 'The Lab Reference (like DTP20261019F1-3) is the number of one report: DTP, the date it was opened, the report type code and a running number. It is how you find, open and approve a report.'),
            $k('What is a test method?', 'what is a test method, what is VF, vf test method meaning, test method code, what do vf codes mean, what is vf-b04, method code meaning, ano ang test method', 'A test method (VF-A01, VF-B04 ...) is the written procedure for one test: what it measures, the equipment, the steps and the conditions. NEXUS-L holds the VF methods by group (strength, abrasion, adhesion, ...). Ask "what is VF-B04" or "test for hydrolysis".'),
            $k('Which test do I use for ...?', 'which test do i use, what test for, test for sole peeling, which test method for, what test to do, what should i test, test to check, anong test para sa, which procedure for, recommended test', 'Describe the problem or the material in your own words, for example "my sole is peeling", "test for zipper" or "which test is for abrasion". I name the matching VF test methods and what each measures.'),
        ];
    }
